    <string name="authentication_graphene_notice">The GrapheneOS lockscreen PIN is the only credential UncleCarbon relies on. For a duress credential, use GrapheneOS Settings → Security → Duress password/PIN. UncleCarbon does not implement its own PINs.</string>
