    <string name="permissions_required_dialog_message">Uncle Carbon needs these permissions to protect your device:\n\n• Camera: Take photos of intruders\n• Location: Send your location in emergencies\n• SMS: Send and receive remote commands\n• Microphone: Record ambient audio\n• Notifications: Show alerts</string>
